<title>USA: Steel Dynamics Inc Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Steel Dynamics Inc Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUTLER, Ind. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					  Three Months (13 Weeks) Ended</p>
<p>					  Mar 31, 1997     Mar 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales				   $98,059	    $32,287</p>
<p>Cost and expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of goods sold		     73,910	     35,184</p>
<p>Selling, general, &amp; administrative</p>
<p>     expenses				  5,339		2,765</p>
<p> Operating income (loss)		  18,810	    (5,662)</p>
<p> Interest and other, net		   1,557		5,590</p>
<p> Income (loss) before income taxes    17,253	   (11,252)</p>
<p>   Income taxes				2,668		   52</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			  14,585	   (11,304)</p>
<p> Net Income (loss) per share		0.30	     (0.35)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>   shares outstanding		     47,838	     32,672</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 start-up costs were $1.4 million vs $700,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 steel production 275,000 vs 128,000 tons. Q1 1997 sales were 280,000 tons compared with 115,000 tons.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
